# test-fixtures/.gitignore — keep recipe + manifest committed; ignore
# fixture build output (each build.sh-generated fixture dir is itself
# a git repo whose contents should not be re-committed here).
#
# Static-snapshot fixtures (NOT regenerable via build.sh) are
# explicitly committed via per-directory exceptions below.
#
# See test-fixtures/README.md for the rebuild recipe and the
# per-fixture README for snapshot provenance.

*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!build.sh
!manifest.txt

# Static-snapshot fixtures (committed verbatim — no build.sh recipe):
!v11-trinity-marker-prepped/
!v11-trinity-marker-prepped/**
